# Risebird

## Layers
Web/Services/Functions → Business → Repository → SQL Server. External APIs in CommonHelper.

## Docs (read one, not all)
Index: `Docs/README.md`. Key: Architecture, VoiceAgents, Database, AzureSearch, Deployment.

## Conventions
- SQL changes: `Risebird.DB/StoredProcedures/` + optional `Migrations/` script
- Minimize diff scope; match existing naming and patterns
- `Candidate.IRFId` is INT (`IRF.id`); `InterviewMeetings.IRFId` is VARCHAR (`IRF.IRFId`)
- Interview dates IST; Plivo log timestamps UTC
- Do not commit secrets from appsettings

